 "review": {
  "management_type_reason": "'Monstrosa Purple' と同じ文なので同じ B。MBG・NC State（種）: 花後に花穂を取ると二番花。品種の文はおぎはら楽天の「種がこぼれた後に花茎を切る程度」",
  "management_type_quote": "Removal of flower spikes after bloom will encourage a secondary bloom.",
  "management_type_by_matching": "B 花後刈込型",
  "heat_west_only": "中",
  "muggy_west_only": null,
  "heat_muggy_west_evidence": "[おぎはら/品種] 耐暑性；中\n[おぎはら楽天/品種] 耐湿性: やや弱い ある程度耐えますが高温多湿 は嫌います（蒸れ 弱 相当）\n[NC State/種] Foxglove does best with afternoon shade.",
  "spread_evidence": "[こぼれ種 2／NC State・種] Deadhead after flowering to avoid excessive numbers of seedlings／[MBG・種] freely self-seed（読み直し）\n[こぼれ種 2／MBG・種] If flower spikes are left in place after flowering and allowed to go to seed, plants will act more as biennials and will, in optimum growing conditions, freely self-seed.\n[こぼれ種の食い違い] Gaißmayer は 1 相当、stauden.de は 1 相当\n[増え方] こぼれ種・地下茎の段階に合わせて直した（前：株立ち）",
  "mixing_evidence": "[stauden.de・種] Wuchsverhalten: horstig, lockerhorstig, horstbildend\n[こぼれ種 2 の基準 2026-11-24] こぼれ種 2 で、雑草化・群落・野生化の記述があるので 強い：[読み直し] こぼれ種2＋[MBG・種] often establishing large colonies",
  "silhouette_evidence": "（種の記述）[NC State・種] Habit/Form: Clumping; Dense; Erect",
